<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/target/shacl-af> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/lossyDrop> "actual: ground axiom <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ruleFrontierBlockedCapability> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> \"Derives logic:FrontierBlockedCapabilityOrResource for a frontier entry whose step axis is waiting and whose action is the blocked step of an operational capability gap. The gap is an operational one — a capability the deployment does not have — and never a reasoning-profile gap, so this rule is also where the non-conflation is enforced by construction rather than by a reviewer noticing.\" is an asserted fact (not a class/property subsumption), so it has no SHACL-AF sh:SPARQLRule derivation form and is carried in the canonical RDF-1.2 layer" .
