<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/target/shacl-af> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/lossyDrop> "ground class/property subsumption axioms are projected as cax-sco / prp-spo1 sh:SPARQLRule shapes; every other ground axiom (type / metamodel assertions, asserted relations, domain/range, modal or scoped axioms, literal-valued assertions) is not a derivation rule, has no SHACL-AF form, and is carried in the canonical RDF-1.2 layer (recorded as a drop)" .
